## Scope & Methodology

**Scope.** {{ dash .Scope }}. Application source code only; runtime, infrastructure, and hosted third-party services are out of scope for this SAST engagement.

**Methodology.** Source files were evaluated against deterministic rules covering injection, XSS, hardcoded secrets, vulnerable dependencies, command injection, weak cryptography, and insecure deserialization. Each finding carries a stable fingerprint, a CWE reference where applicable, and a CVSS v3.1 base score.

